<b>You want my expert insight? Well, here it is: I got here last night, didn’t see a damn thing, and I like to think I’d notice a murder happening in the middle of the road.</b> He shrugs. 
<b>Honestly, the place was way too quiet. You ever walk into a town and feel like you missed the part where everyone got raptured? Yeah, it was like that.</b> He smirks, waiting for a reaction. When we don’t respond, he sighs.
<b>Alright, tough crowd. Well, if you ever wanna investigate some good deals, my shop’s open. Dead or alive, everyone’s a customer.</b>
